=2 Walkthrough
* Defeat 5 {m:Rustwater Toads|Rustwater Toad} and/or {m:Spoutdrenched Toads|Spoutdrenched Toad} in {z:Rala Waterways}. You do not need to be in EXP range as long as you are in {z:Rala Waterways} when your party/alliance defeats the monsters.
** The closest entrance for the frogs is from {z:Western Adoulin}, southeast of the Mog House (The frogs are the southwest corner of {z:Rala Waterways})
** {m:Rustwater Toad} and {m:Spoutdrenched Toads|Spoutdrenched Toad} are mixed with {m:Waterway Pugils|Waterway Pugil} and {m:Stillwater Funguar} at: C/D-9, D-8/9, D/E-10.
** AOEing them will only give you credit for one kill (I used Thunderspark and killed 4, only got credit for one)

